(7651233, 1244711, 35078, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GolferDDS:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting shot. Im trying to figure out if that is a side view mirror on a vehicle or a mirror on a pole. Also what perplexes me is that the road that the truck in the mirror is so much wider and paved versus the road ahead. Is this a side road off the Main Street? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hello, it''s a mirror on a pole. I drive milk tanker truck and trailer units for Fonterra, here in New Zealand. That is a farm track and actually one of the better ones. People are often surprised where we can take the trucks lol.</td>', 'Originally posted by GolferDDS: Interesting shot. Im trying to figure out if that is a side view mirror on a vehicle or a mirror on a pole. Also what perplexes me is that the road that the truck in the mirror is so much wider and paved versus the road ahead. Is this a side road off the Main Street?   Hello, it''s a mirror on a pole. I drive milk tanker truck and trailer units for Fonterra, here in New Zealand. That is a farm track and actually one of the better ones. People are often surprised where we can take the trucks lol.', '2020-01-22 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
